{"3986860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scarlet O'Beetle and the Unseen World ", "steam_appid": 3986860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/e497878bc64fe2022dbc5b6e62cfb3b8.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/e497878bc64fe2022dbc5b6e62cfb3b8.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/63f67260eef125f7ea6a5d960cf80213.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/63f67260eef125f7ea6a5d960cf80213.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/63f67260eef125f7ea6a5d960cf80213.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cook, craft, forage... all the mechanics you love with a fresh perspective and new ingredients.<br>Our main character is a doctor, so we have a new patient management mechanic: prepare medicine, fix ailments, get paid. From broken wings to nectar poisoning and parasites,  all the village critters come to Scarlet with their problems.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/905c6c782fd7a7999270dfbd4a01e01f.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/905c6c782fd7a7999270dfbd4a01e01f.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/9291d5ae099901d18d074b24b1bc3f88.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/9291d5ae099901d18d074b24b1bc3f88.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/9291d5ae099901d18d074b24b1bc3f88.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Socialize, make friends, find love... but don’t forget to spend quality time with Twinkle.   <br>A dashing bumblebee surgeon, a cool waterslider surfer, two warring ant cowboys, and a wasp prince are all vying for your affections. Work, friends, love and a morose teenage nephew... can you have it all?<br>Sometimes we just need a break to bust a move or take a pollen bath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/86d98fe227c163c5cbce76044da982f4.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/86d98fe227c163c5cbce76044da982f4.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/5076c3b133ed3d6ea09d10297f3dcdab.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/5076c3b133ed3d6ea09d10297f3dcdab.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/5076c3b133ed3d6ea09d10297f3dcdab.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The sudden illness of your best friend, Bianca the yellow loosestrife bee, is beyond suspicious.<br>Who sent that mysterious note? What could they want? The honeybee queen seems reluctant to share information. Is this about the Council of Pollinators?<br><br>Follow the story’s many twists and turns, meet fun characters, discover new locations and puzzle facts together to unravel the mystery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/f2cdb771e0bd7e7dab8e2134b1952e84.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/f2cdb771e0bd7e7dab8e2134b1952e84.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/87947b8c6f89f303bcde0a8ff48d8cc7.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/87947b8c6f89f303bcde0a8ff48d8cc7.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/87947b8c6f89f303bcde0a8ff48d8cc7.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The plants and insect characters  were chosen specifically for their weird and amazing characteristics, making them uniquely entertaining.<br>Finally, you’ll be able to show off in front of your judgy friends who think gaming is a waste of time. <br>Do they know what oil bees are? What about nyctinasty? They don’t, but you will now! All that cooking, crafting, socializing game time will also make your REAL life better. What Scarlet promises, she delivers!<br><br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 30 original characters—insects, mollusks, arachnids, and more—each with their own charm and secrets to share.<br></li><li>Storylines with meaning—quests woven from the real wonders of nature, like insect–plant bonds, pollination, symbiosis. No empty grinding, only tasks that matter.<br></li><li>A living world of 250+ interactive species of plants, mosses, lichens, and fungi—gathered by Scarlet to craft gourmet dishes, medicines, arts and crafts and many more.<br></li><li>All the gathering, cooking, and crafting mechanics that you love reimagined with nature’s treasures: varied pollens, nectars, resins, waxes, silks, seeds, fibers etc, like you have not seen before.<br></li><li>A new medical office mechanic where tending to insect patients is as delightful as it is rewarding. Earn well-deserved honors for your efforts (Doctor of Lepidopteran Orthopedy, anyone?)<br></li><li>Full game will have 40+ hours of immersive gameplay, rich with discovery and wonder.<br></li><li>Original musical earworms and playful covers featuring the very sounds of the insect world. </li></ul><br>[/p]", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/e497878bc64fe2022dbc5b6e62cfb3b8.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/e497878bc64fe2022dbc5b6e62cfb3b8.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/63f67260eef125f7ea6a5d960cf80213.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/63f67260eef125f7ea6a5d960cf80213.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/63f67260eef125f7ea6a5d960cf80213.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cook, craft, forage... all the mechanics you love with a fresh perspective and new ingredients.<br>Our main character is a doctor, so we have a new patient management mechanic: prepare medicine, fix ailments, get paid. From broken wings to nectar poisoning and parasites,  all the village critters come to Scarlet with their problems.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/905c6c782fd7a7999270dfbd4a01e01f.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/905c6c782fd7a7999270dfbd4a01e01f.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/9291d5ae099901d18d074b24b1bc3f88.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/9291d5ae099901d18d074b24b1bc3f88.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/9291d5ae099901d18d074b24b1bc3f88.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Socialize, make friends, find love... but don’t forget to spend quality time with Twinkle.   <br>A dashing bumblebee surgeon, a cool waterslider surfer, two warring ant cowboys, and a wasp prince are all vying for your affections. Work, friends, love and a morose teenage nephew... can you have it all?<br>Sometimes we just need a break to bust a move or take a pollen bath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/86d98fe227c163c5cbce76044da982f4.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/86d98fe227c163c5cbce76044da982f4.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/5076c3b133ed3d6ea09d10297f3dcdab.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/5076c3b133ed3d6ea09d10297f3dcdab.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/5076c3b133ed3d6ea09d10297f3dcdab.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The sudden illness of your best friend, Bianca the yellow loosestrife bee, is beyond suspicious.<br>Who sent that mysterious note? What could they want? The honeybee queen seems reluctant to share information. Is this about the Council of Pollinators?<br><br>Follow the story’s many twists and turns, meet fun characters, discover new locations and puzzle facts together to unravel the mystery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/f2cdb771e0bd7e7dab8e2134b1952e84.avif?t=1783009292\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras_big/f2cdb771e0bd7e7dab8e2134b1952e84.webp?t=1783009292 width=1560 height=312 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/87947b8c6f89f303bcde0a8ff48d8cc7.poster.avif?t=1783009292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/87947b8c6f89f303bcde0a8ff48d8cc7.webm?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/extras/87947b8c6f89f303bcde0a8ff48d8cc7.mp4?t=1783009292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The plants and insect characters  were chosen specifically for their weird and amazing characteristics, making them uniquely entertaining.<br>Finally, you’ll be able to show off in front of your judgy friends who think gaming is a waste of time. <br>Do they know what oil bees are? What about nyctinasty? They don’t, but you will now! All that cooking, crafting, socializing game time will also make your REAL life better. What Scarlet promises, she delivers!<br><br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 30 original characters—insects, mollusks, arachnids, and more—each with their own charm and secrets to share.<br></li><li>Storylines with meaning—quests woven from the real wonders of nature, like insect–plant bonds, pollination, symbiosis. No empty grinding, only tasks that matter.<br></li><li>A living world of 250+ interactive species of plants, mosses, lichens, and fungi—gathered by Scarlet to craft gourmet dishes, medicines, arts and crafts and many more.<br></li><li>All the gathering, cooking, and crafting mechanics that you love reimagined with nature’s treasures: varied pollens, nectars, resins, waxes, silks, seeds, fibers etc, like you have not seen before.<br></li><li>A new medical office mechanic where tending to insect patients is as delightful as it is rewarding. Earn well-deserved honors for your efforts (Doctor of Lepidopteran Orthopedy, anyone?)<br></li><li>Full game will have 40+ hours of immersive gameplay, rich with discovery and wonder.<br></li><li>Original musical earworms and playful covers featuring the very sounds of the insect world. </li></ul><br>[/p]", "short_description": "Scarlet O’Beetle and the Unseen World is a vibrant cozy life-sim game set in Buzzing Meadows, a magical insect village. Collect unique ingredients, heal patients, befriend and romance a colorful cast of critters and pursue the elusive cure to save your best friend Bianca, the yellow loosestrife bee.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/66f89d49887ff4c1a50429fb0e3e02bcb8a13581/header.jpg?t=1783009292", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/44e8839c9aefd0b0acb8d24105946268c0911757/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783009292", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986860/44e8839c9aefd0b0acb8d24105946268c0911757/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783009292", "website": "https://www.scarletobeetle.eu", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 2GB graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 2GB graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Midain Studios"], "publishers": ["Midain Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, 